1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:03,460
(Sheldon:)Amy, don't you agree we should
leave now and get in line?

2
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:07,360
(Amy:)Actually, as the newest member
of your social group,

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,500
(Amy:)I believe I'll gain more
acceptance by arbitrarily

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,860
(Amy:)siding with your friends
from time to time.

5
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:14,870
(Sheldon:)Shrewd.

6
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:17,340
(Amy:)Leonard, you're right.

7
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:19,370
(Amy:)We should enjoy our meal,
arrive late,

8
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:21,070
(Amy:)and risk winding up
with terrible seats,

9
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:23,180
(Amy:)assuming we get in at all.

10
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,880
(Leonard:)Thank you, Amy.

11
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:28,380
(Amy:)See? It's working.

12
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,420
(Bernadette:)Knock-knock.

13
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,470
(Howard:)Who's there?

14
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,480
(Bernadette:)Olive.

15
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:35,450
(Howard:)Olive you, too.

16
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,860
(Leonard:)Guys, that's really
starting to get old.

17
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:38,970
(Bernadette:)Knock-knock.

18
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,030
(Howard:)Who's there?

19
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:42,860
(Howard:)I have a girlfriend
and you don't.

20
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,980
(Leonard:)Hysterical!

21
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:47,100
(Sheldon:)Wait, now, we don't know
that yet. He isn't finished.

22
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,970
I have a girlfriend
and you don't who?

23
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:54,110
So. Are you sure you don't want
to come with us to Raiders?

24
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:57,110
(Bernadette:)Oh, no. That movie
has melting faces.

25
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:58,740
(Bernadette:)It reminds me
too much of the time

26
00:00:58,750 --> 00:01:00,850
(Bernadette:)I dropped that vial of
flesh-eating bacteria

